    desc:'A rich, slightly elliptical globular cluster in Aquarius, and the first of its kind to enter Messier\'s catalogue. It appears to be a survivor of the Gaia-Enceladus dwarf galaxy that merged with the Milky Way, and Gaia has traced a long tidal stream of stars trailing behind it.',
